  audioNarracion: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7937831cff2238418281d918821c3a4, type: 3}
  volumenAudio: 0.8
  textoFragmento: 'It was Halloween night.

    A group of children played around
    the neighborhood, asking for candy and telling scary stories.

    Among the
    dares and giggles, one of them challenged a girl to light a candle at the entrance
    of the old abandoned house at the edge of town.

    The girl, determined to
    prove her courage, took the candle and walked toward the porch.

    But as
    she stepped onto the old floorboards, they gave way beneath her feet

    and
    she fell into the dark cellar of the house.'
